## Session End (MANDATORY)
Update these files with what you accomplished:
1. memory-bank/activeContext.md — What changed, new findings, next steps
2. memory-bank/progress.md — Mark items done, add new items

## Rules
- patients.id = UUID, hospitals.id = INTEGER, users.id = INTEGER
- Never add fallback defaults without checking the actual frontend payload
- Production DB access via exec-sql backdoor (see memory-bank/techContext.md)
- SSH to VPS is broken — do not attempt SCP or SSH commands
